{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub038_adultm_01",
      "hash": "f87cb4ed9d98299a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我啊……\\n很不擅長培育寶可夢。\\c\\n讓這隻小火龍一直\\n弱弱的也挺可憐，\\c\\n所以我想把牠交給一個\\n比我更厲害的訓練家。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub038_adultm_05",
      "hash": "f87cb0ed9d9822ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳捉到的寶可夢有……\\n[VAR NUM9(0000,0000)]隻啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub038_adultm_06",
      "hash": "f87cafed9d98211b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真厲害！我想請[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳\\n收下這隻小火龍！怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub038_adultm_02",
      "hash": "f87cb3ed9d9827e7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那就拜託[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub038_adultm_07",
      "hash": "f87caeed9d981f68",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我捉到的寶可夢有[VAR NUM3(0000)]隻。\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳至少要比我多吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub038_adultm_03",
      "hash": "f87cb2ed9d982634",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這樣啊……\\n只好把牠送到博士那裡了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub038_adultm_04",
      "hash": "f87cb1ed9d982481",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳有在培育\\n我那時送[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的小火龍嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub038_poke_01",
      "hash": "a722653a024051d0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小火龍「火龍龍～"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
